{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile settings and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727, outperforming the singleprofile baseline (config_001). The results suggest multiprofile settings and aggregation may contribute to improved performance, but the exact impact of each factor remains unclear without direct comparison. The role of alternative RNA encoders or image modalities is still uncertain."
}

